OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start to the day with
OL,6,Fpatchy rain or showers continuing,
OL,7,Fthese potentially heavy at first.
OL,8,FCloud and rain clearing to the east
OL,9,Fwith skies potentially turning
OL,10,Fbrighter. Warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLargely dry for many
OL,13,Fovernight with clear spells across the
OL,14,Fregion, chance of an occasional shower
OL,15,Facross parts of Cumbria.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FA dry and bright start, but
OL,18,Fturning increasing cloudy from mid
OL,19,Fmorning with outbreaks of rain
OL,20,Freaching the region. Temperatures
OL,21,Fgenerally above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
